Amira Valliani, Head of Payments Growth at the Solana Foundation, on the token supercycle

“You see tokens in crypto, you see tokens in AI, and it’s tokens all the way down. A token is just a machine-readable format of an asset. Over the next 10 years it’s going to be really obvious that anything that’s an asset can be a token.”

@amiravalliani @NYSE
